  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Theodore
  characterDescription: Theodore used to be an enginner for the french army, but
    not anymore. Having seen many atrocities during his deployment in Africa, he
    deserted the army and tried to escape court martial. Is it fate that struck his
    plane bringing it down for his crimes? Is it supposed to be an atonement for
    his sins? "God, why did you take lives of others from that plane to punish me"
    he asks himself daily unable to let go of his guilt.
