  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Charlotte
  characterDescription: Charlotte's life wasn't supposed to be like this, all she
    was supposed to do was to marry the one her family chose for her, but fate had
    other plans and instead she met her true love and escaped with him, which made
    her life truly worth living, something she didn't believe she deserved. Due to
    her lack of education she used to be a housewife for her beloved husband and
    three beautiful children, now she wants to forget they ever existed, maybe then
    she can stop wishing she died with them in that crash.
