  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Sabrina
  characterDescription: Sabrina was always a little bit different, if by little you
    mean a lot obviously. She never played with other girls, instead prefering to
    venture into the forests alone, despite her parents forbiding her from it. This
    kind of upbringing made her a social outcast, but one very skilled in exactly
    the kind of things this dire situation calls for, as long as other survivors
    can trust her.
